        "input": {
          "instructions": "Clear, measured, and instructor-ready.",
          "text": "The selected server returns DHCPACK, confirming the lease and options. The client configures the interface and enters the bound state. A lease is temporary. At the first renewal timer, the client usually unicasts a request to the original server. If that fails, a later rebinding timer allows broadcast requests to any server. If the lease expires without renewal, the address must no longer be used. These timers let address pools be reused while keeping stable configuration during normal operation."
        },
